graph TD
    A[Calcium Signal] --> B[NOS Activation]
    B --> C[L-Arginine Conversion]
    C --> D[NO Production]
    D --> E[NO Diffusion]
    E --> F[sGC Activation]
    F --> G[cGMP Production]
    G --> H[PKG Activation]
    H --> I[Target Protein Phosphorylation]
    I --> J[Vasodilation Response]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    E --> K[Direct Protein Modification]
    K --> L[S-Nitrosylation]
